0.9.1 23oct2026
* diagnostic script: --get-* options take no argument, --get-precip works
* convert imperial hail values to hits/cm2 by dividing, not multiplying
* configuration prompts offer serial and tcp only and keep the model
* CRC calculation follows the user guide (XOR, 0xA001) and returns the three
  CRC characters. Only the --test-crc option of the diagnostic script uses it.
* hail values in unit H (hits without area) are dropped instead of being
  reported as hits/cm2
* diagnostic script: --protocol accepts serial and tcp, with --tcp-address
  and --tcp-port

0.9.0 22oct2026
* support a TCP serial server: protocol = tcp, with tcp_address and tcp_port.
  The driver connects on the first poll and reconnects after end of stream or
  a socket error. A failed connection does not stop the driver from loading.
* remove NULL characters from replies (the cleaned line was discarded)

0.7 21feb2024
* fixed rain calculation when rain_total is None

